<section class="reic-module" data-reic-module="135"><header><span class="reic-kicker">PERSONALISASI</span><h2>Pusat Tema</h2></header><p>Pilih tema visual untuk area kerja REIC.</p><form data-reic-form><label for="theme-choice">Tema</label><select id="theme-choice" name="theme"><option value="dark">Gelap</option><option value="light">Terang</option><option value="system">Ikuti sistem</option></select><button type="submit">SIMPAN TEMA</button></form><output class="reic-status" aria-live="polite">Tema saat ini: Gelap.</output></section>
